{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0<strong>A Dialogue Within</strong>\u00a0</i>is a psychological narrative experience that takes players on a journey through the fading fragments of the human mind.  As you explore, reality itself begins to unravel\u2014objects disappear when you turn away, sounds become distant, and the world slowly loses its color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What first appears to be a surreal\u00a0 story gradually reveals something deeper. The shadows, the whispers, the sense of danger\u2014they are not supernatural, but reflections of the protagonist\u2019s own struggle with depression and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Dialogue Within</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>invites players to feel rather than simply play. Through atmosphere, sound design, and subtle changes in the environment, it transforms mental decline into a living, immersive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121210?t=1763400325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121210?t=1763400325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121210/d7eb285bc7705db4d33c5a769e70e57e810f80be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763400325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121210/d7eb285bc7705db4d33c5a769e70e57e810f80be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763400325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids"